    "agent_final_response": "\n\nI've completed the at-risk deals report as requested by Patricia Lin in the #sales-alerts Slack channel. Here's what I did:\n\n**1. Read the Slack channel:** Found Patricia Lin's request for an at-risk deals report identifying opportunities stuck in Prospecting or Qualification stages with deal values over $50,000.\n\n**2. Queried opportunities:** Searched the CRM for all opportunities in both \"Prospecting\" and \"Qualification\" stages.\n\n**3. Identified at-risk deals:** Found 4 deals meeting the criteria:\n   - **Meridian Tech Platform**: Prospecting, $75,000\n   - **AI Integration**: Prospecting, $300,000\n   - **Atlas Corp Data Migration**: Qualification, $110,000\n   - **Horizon Labs AI Suite**: Qualification, $88,000\n\n**4. Sent email alert:** Successfully sent the at-risk deals report to sales.director@company.com with the complete list and total ($573,000 across 4 deals).\n\n**5. Posted to Slack:** Shared the findings in #sales-alerts channel with all at-risk deals and the total summary.\n\nThe team has been alerted about these high-value deals that may need attention to move through the pipeline.",
